   "format": "mcq",
   "stem": {
      "text": "Let F be the antiderivative of \\( f(x) = x \\left(1 - x^{2}\\right)^{4} \\) with \\( F(0) = 1 \\). Find the exact value of \\( F\\left(1\\right) \\)."
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
      "mathjson": [
         "Rational",
         11,
         10
      ]
   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Let \\( u = 1 - x^{2} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Add",
            1,
            [
               "Negate",
               [
                  "Power",
                  "x",
                  2
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Then \\( du = - 2 x \\, dx \\), so \\( x \\, dx = - \\frac{1}{2} \\, du \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            -1,
            2
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Since \\( F(1) = F(0) + \\int_{0}^{1} x \\left(1 - x^{2}\\right)^{4} \\, dx \\), convert the limits: \\( x = 0 \\) gives \\( u = 1 \\) and \\( x = 1 \\) gives \\( u = 0 \\), so the integral becomes \\( \\int_{1}^{0} - \\frac{u^{4}}{2} \\, du \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Negate",
            [
               "Divide",
               [
                  "Power",
                  "u",
                  4
               ],
               2
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "An antiderivative of \\( - \\frac{u^{4}}{2} \\) is \\( - \\frac{u^{5}}{10} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Negate",
            [
               "Divide",
               [
                  "Power",
                  "u",
                  5
               ],
               10
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 5,
         "text": "The integral is \\( 0 - \\left(- \\frac{1}{10}\\right) = \\frac{1}{10} \\), so \\( F(1) = 1 + \\frac{1}{10} = \\frac{11}{10} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            11,
            10
         ]
      }
   ],
